## 4. Phase 3 Integration Blueprint (Next to Build)

This diagram shows how the new core blocking services (Accessibility, VPN, and Overlay) integrate into the existing architectural map:

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Services ["Core Blocking Services (Phase 3)"]
        AccService[FocusAccessibilityService]
        VpnService[FocusVpnService]
        OverlayService[BlockingOverlayService]
    end

    subgraph Repos ["Repositories (Phase 1/2)"]
        BlockRepo[BlockingRepository]
        SessionRepo[SessionRepository]
    end

    subgraph OS ["Android Operating System"]
        Browser[Browser URL Bar] -->|Read by| AccService
        DNS[On-Device DNS Intercept] -->|Interceded by| VpnService
        SystemUI[System Settings Screens] -->|Monitored by| AccService
    end

    AccService -->|Checks active session| SessionRepo
    AccService -->|Checks keywords| BlockRepo
    VpnService -->|Checks domain category| BlockRepo
    
    AccService -->|Triggers overlay| OverlayService
    VpnService -->|Redirects DNS block to| OverlayService

    style Services fill:#1abc9c,stroke:#16a085,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style Repos fill:#8e44ad,stroke:#9b59b6,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    style OS fill:#7f8c8d,stroke:#95a5a6,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
```
